  "title": "Scripps to release second-quarter 2026 operating results on Aug. 6",
  "summary": "CINCINNATI – The E.W. Scripps Company (NASDAQ: SSP) will report second-quarter 2026 operating results after the markets close on Thursday, Aug. 6. The call with the company’s senior management team will take place at 9:30 a.m. Eastern time on Friday, Aug. 7.",
